        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Philip Seymour Hoffman, James, Donald Miller, Joseph Foster\n- Roles: actor, director, producer, student\n- Topics: film career, death, school attention\n\nFacts:\n- Philip Seymour Hoffman was an American actor, director, and producer known for distinctive supporting and character roles such as lowlifes, eccentrics, bullies, and misfits.\n- Philip Seymour Hoffman acted in many films from the early 1990s until his death at age 46 in 2010.\n- James indicated that there might be too much personal attention involving the school's only Black student, Donald Miller.\n- Donald Miller was portrayed by Joseph Foster.",
